{
  "description": "Optimized LV2 effects - Best-in-class plugins only (redundant plugins moved to JUCE native)",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "source": "https://github.com/rerdavies/ToobAmp + Dragonfly Reverb",
  "note": "JUCE native processors (Dynamics, EQ, NAM, IR) are now the primary choice. LV2 plugins complement them.",
